Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua obra parou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Por onde começar?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.93,0:00:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Primeiro, é preciso entender o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,que já foi feito e
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.97,0:00:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,o que ainda falta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A A.F confere a obra
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,em campo, compara os serviços
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,com o projeto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.83,0:00:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,e organiza o orçamento das
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,etapas restantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.55,0:00:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Assim, você tem informação técnica
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,para avaliar os próximos passos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Converse com a A.F sobre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a sua obra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.00,Notice,,0,0,0,,Cenas ilustrativas
